---
description: One main React component per file; do not split UI into tiny components
globs: frontend/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: true
---

# Component files

- One main component per file. Name the file after that component.
- A screen only composes those components. Do not declare sibling screens in the same file.
- Keep a section's list, empty state, and loading state in that section's file.
- Do not extract a component that is only a few lines and used once.
- Leave `components/ui` primitives grouped the way the design system exports them.
